          "text": "Every employee at Motos America hears \"Live the Passion. Take the Ride.\" during their own department academy. What they actually believe about that phrase — whether it's a real operating standard or just a slogan — gets decided almost entirely by what they watch their manager do, especially under pressure. You don't set culture by talking about it. You set it by what you model, what you correct, and what you let slide."
